WEBVTT

00:01.001 --> 00:03.837
Hey, answer the damn question, you twit.

00:04.587 --> 00:06.131
What do you want to do?

00:11.553 --> 00:13.471
I want to join the Scout Regiment

00:14.264 --> 00:16.683
and slaughter every Titan I can!

00:19.352 --> 00:21.521
Not bad.

00:23.148 --> 00:26.317
I'll take responsibility for him, Erwin.

00:27.318 --> 00:28.945
Let the higher-ups know.

00:29.821 --> 00:32.407
I don't necessarily trust him, though.

00:32.907 --> 00:35.160
If he betrays us or goes out of control,

00:35.410 --> 00:37.078
I'll kill him on the spot.

00:38.163 --> 00:39.956
The top brass won't complain.

00:40.331 --> 00:42.542
Because I'm the only one cut out for this.

00:43.585 --> 00:44.794
You're in.

00:45.545 --> 00:47.881
I'll make you a member of
the Scout Regiment.

02:38.950 --> 02:43.037
Hey, is it true that
a Titan sided with humans?

02:43.288 --> 02:45.290
That's obviously just a rumor.

02:45.582 --> 02:47.083
I bet the recapture plan failed

02:47.292 --> 02:50.587
and a lot of people from Wall Rose
are going to flee here.

02:50.670 --> 02:53.423
WITHIN WALL SINA

02:53.882 --> 02:57.594
If that happens, we'll have
food shortages in no time.

02:57.677 --> 03:01.347
Man, please tell me those Wall Rose people

03:01.556 --> 03:05.351
aren't going to show up here
with this Titan friend of theirs...

03:05.435 --> 03:07.186
WALL SINA
WALL ROSE

03:07.270 --> 03:09.272
This is huge news!

03:09.480 --> 03:11.691
We have a Titan on our side now!

03:11.774 --> 03:12.609
WITHIN WALL ROSE

03:12.692 --> 03:16.195
Who knows, maybe we can even
retake Wall Maria!

03:16.404 --> 03:18.156
It's almost like it's...

03:18.239 --> 03:19.574
our savior!

03:25.455 --> 03:27.332
Our savior?

03:29.167 --> 03:32.462
Throughout history,
commoners have always been a rash lot.

03:34.172 --> 03:37.258
I can see this triggering a revolt
against the Royal Government...

03:37.675 --> 03:42.138
Not if we, the Military Police,
dispose of Eren Jaeger first.

03:42.972 --> 03:45.391
I won't let those deviants
in the Scout Regiment have him.

03:49.103 --> 03:50.104
Fall in!

03:59.280 --> 04:00.949
Hail to the Premier!

04:04.244 --> 04:05.662
It's certainly hot.

04:07.872 --> 04:08.873
Commander Pyxis.

04:09.499 --> 04:11.668
You're the top commander
of the Garrison Regiment

04:11.751 --> 04:14.837
and I'm a commanding officer
of the Scout Regiment.

04:14.921 --> 04:17.674
Won't some disapprove
of us meeting like this?

04:18.216 --> 04:21.886
Oh, you're as straight-laced
as the rumors say.

04:22.553 --> 04:24.931
Still, this is just a morning walk.

04:25.223 --> 04:27.267
We only met by chance.

04:28.977 --> 04:32.105
So, let's chat during our little stroll.

04:33.231 --> 04:35.024
Have you heard that the Military Police

04:35.108 --> 04:37.735
wants to take custody of Eren Jaeger?

04:38.152 --> 04:40.697
Yes, I received word yesterday.

04:41.322 --> 04:43.533
They're going to hold
a deliberation on the matter.

04:43.741 --> 04:44.575
I see.

04:44.742 --> 04:46.869
It falls entirely on Zachary to decide

04:47.120 --> 04:52.417
whether the Scout Regiment
or the Military Police gets him.

04:52.583 --> 04:53.793
Zachary...

04:54.252 --> 04:56.254
You mean Premier Dhalis Zachary?

04:57.547 --> 04:58.715
He oversees the three regiments,

04:58.798 --> 05:03.511
the Garrison Regiment, the Scout Regiment,
and the Military Police.

05:04.178 --> 05:06.848
He will base his decision on one thing,

05:06.931 --> 05:11.436
which is whether Eren Jaeger's existence
is beneficial or harmful to humanity.

05:11.811 --> 05:16.107
If he deems him a detriment,
he won't hesitate to have Eren executed.

05:16.607 --> 05:18.067
Right there on the spot, even.

05:19.277 --> 05:21.612
I don't want them to kill Eren.

05:22.530 --> 05:25.199
But unfortunately,
many in the Garrison Regiment

05:25.408 --> 05:29.203
are fearful of Eren's ability.

05:29.871 --> 05:35.043
The most I can do is avoid agreeing
with the Military Police.

05:37.253 --> 05:38.755
Are the odds in your favor?

05:40.214 --> 05:41.049
No.

05:42.258 --> 05:44.510
But we do have a proposal ready.

05:46.095 --> 05:49.265
Whether it will work or not
depends on how the debate unfolds.

05:50.683 --> 05:53.436
In other words,
you'll be playing it entirely by ear?

05:54.228 --> 05:56.481
Our line of work
takes us outside the walls.

05:56.564 --> 05:58.649
We always play things by ear.

06:01.486 --> 06:04.238
It seems you're not so uptight after all.

06:05.073 --> 06:07.909
This has been a nice walk,
Commander Smith.

06:14.415 --> 06:15.583
A debate over Eren?

06:16.626 --> 06:17.460
What for?

06:17.543 --> 06:19.087
I'm not really sure,

06:19.170 --> 06:21.380
but I think it's about
what they plan to do with him.

06:21.464 --> 06:22.757
What do you mean?

06:23.091 --> 06:24.008
My guess is...

06:24.884 --> 06:26.761
they're going to decide
whether he should live or die.

06:32.225 --> 06:36.104
Are Mikasa Ackermann
and Armin Arlelt here?

06:36.562 --> 06:37.396
Yes!

06:38.147 --> 06:41.776
You are ordered to attend this afternoon's
deliberation as witnesses!

06:51.536 --> 06:53.371
Excuse me. I need to use the toilet...

06:53.538 --> 06:54.997
You just went!

06:56.707 --> 06:57.917
Please give me some water!

06:58.084 --> 06:58.918
Hey!

07:00.294 --> 07:03.172
Know your place, monster.

07:06.551 --> 07:07.885
Monster...

07:08.553 --> 07:11.013
Yes, that might be the case...

07:13.516 --> 07:16.894
but am I so terrifying that
I need to be restrained this much?

07:17.937 --> 07:19.522
I guess I can't blame them, though.

07:20.231 --> 07:22.150
Even I don't understand any of this.

07:23.192 --> 07:26.696
At least they haven't killed me yet.

07:28.656 --> 07:29.824
Come to think of it,

07:30.908 --> 07:34.537
they weren't afraid of me at all.

07:37.373 --> 07:39.208
What are they doing now?

07:43.296 --> 07:46.048
What happened to all the others?

07:50.470 --> 07:52.638
Just hang on a little longer.

07:54.015 --> 07:56.100
We'll try to arrange things somehow.

07:57.310 --> 07:59.103
How many days has it been since then?

08:00.188 --> 08:01.856
What's going on outside?

08:02.607 --> 08:06.986
I'm not going to spend
the rest of my life in here, am I?

08:18.498 --> 08:20.249
So you're Eren?

08:20.416 --> 08:22.001
You okay? How are things?

08:22.710 --> 08:25.046
I'm sorry you've had to wait so long.

08:25.171 --> 08:27.423
But now,
you finally have a chance to get out.

08:28.633 --> 08:29.467
Except,

08:29.926 --> 08:31.719
you'll have to put these on.

08:36.891 --> 08:40.561
I'm Hange Zoë, a section commander
in the Scout Regiment.

08:41.145 --> 08:44.273
And this is Miche Zacharius,
also a section commander.

08:44.357 --> 08:45.441
I...

08:45.983 --> 08:51.072
Oh, he always sniffs people like that
when he first meets them.

08:52.073 --> 08:53.908
He has a habit of
laughing through his nose.

08:54.367 --> 08:56.953
I doubt he means anything by it.

08:57.245 --> 09:00.581
Oddness aside, he is skilled enough
to be a section commander.

09:04.460 --> 09:05.878
Oh, my!

09:06.170 --> 09:08.381
Sorry! I just prattled on, didn't I?

09:08.673 --> 09:10.299
We're already here, but...

09:10.633 --> 09:11.968
No, it will be okay!

09:12.635 --> 09:15.012
It's actually better if I don't explain!

09:16.222 --> 09:17.139
Wait...

09:18.057 --> 09:22.436
It's selfish of us, but all we can do
is put blind faith in you.

09:23.354 --> 09:24.438
Good luck!

09:38.953 --> 09:40.037
A courthouse?

09:41.581 --> 09:44.292
I was in the basement of a courthouse?

09:45.334 --> 09:46.502
Get moving!

09:47.378 --> 09:48.546
Kneel down!

09:59.765 --> 10:01.517
What's with all these people?

10:02.018 --> 10:05.271
In fact, what is this trial even about?

10:07.982 --> 10:08.983
Guys!

10:18.492 --> 10:20.202
Shall we begin?

10:23.331 --> 10:25.291
You are Eren Jaeger,

10:25.916 --> 10:30.421
a soldier who has sworn
to give his life for the people.

10:30.921 --> 10:31.922
Is that correct?

10:32.548 --> 10:33.382
Yes.

10:33.966 --> 10:35.301
Given the extraordinary circumstances,

10:35.760 --> 10:38.304
this deliberation will be held
as a court martial.

10:38.387 --> 10:40.139
Hence, regular law will not apply,
so to speak.

10:40.431 --> 10:43.851
I have full decision-making
authority on this matter,

10:44.894 --> 10:48.731
which includes determining
whether you should live or die.

10:49.106 --> 10:50.107
Just as I thought!

10:50.775 --> 10:52.026
Any objections?

10:53.736 --> 10:54.695
No, sir.

10:55.279 --> 10:57.114
Your astuteness is appreciated.

10:57.657 --> 10:59.158
I'll get right to the point.

11:00.076 --> 11:04.163
As expected, concealing your
existence has proved impossible.

11:04.747 --> 11:08.125
Unless we publicly disclose
your existence in one fashion or another,

11:08.501 --> 11:11.754
we risk the outbreak
of a new, non-Titan threat.

11:12.338 --> 11:17.343
It falls on me to decide which regiment
should take charge of you.

11:18.094 --> 11:19.512
The Military Police Regiment

11:20.429 --> 11:21.764
or the Scout Regiment.

11:23.265 --> 11:26.477
Now, let's hear what
the Military Police Regiment proposes.

11:26.644 --> 11:27.478
Yes, sir.

11:27.645 --> 11:29.855
I, Nile Dawk, Commander
of the Military Police,

11:29.939 --> 11:31.273
offer the following proposal.

11:32.233 --> 11:36.529
We believe that, after a thorough
examination of Eren's body,

11:37.029 --> 11:39.615
he should be disposed of immediately.

11:41.450 --> 11:46.163
It's true that his Titan ability
helped thwart this latest incursion.

11:46.664 --> 11:51.585
However, his existence is now
stirring up rebellious ideas as well.

11:52.545 --> 11:56.841
As such, after he has provided us
with as much information as possible,

11:56.924 --> 11:59.343
he will be made a
fallen warrior of humanity.

12:00.469 --> 12:01.971
There's no need!

12:02.638 --> 12:04.723
He is vermin that
has defiled and infiltrated

12:04.807 --> 12:07.476
- the walls built by God's great wisdom!
- He's with the Church of the Walls!

12:07.560 --> 12:09.979
- He should be killed at once!
- Everyone ignored them five years ago,

12:10.312 --> 12:12.731
- Pastor Nick. Please remain quiet.
- but they've really grown in power.

12:14.024 --> 12:17.194
Next, let us hear
the Scout Regiment's idea.

12:17.695 --> 12:18.529
Yes, sir.

12:19.280 --> 12:22.658
I, Erwin Smith, 13th Commander
of the Scout Regiment,

12:22.741 --> 12:24.118
offer the following proposal.

12:25.161 --> 12:29.415
We intend to accept Eren as
an official member of the Scout Regiment

12:29.707 --> 12:32.960
and utilize his Titan ability
to retake Wall Maria.

12:35.087 --> 12:36.088
That is all.

12:38.007 --> 12:40.050
What? That's all?

12:40.551 --> 12:41.385
Yes, sir.

12:41.677 --> 12:45.097
With his help, we can reclaim Wall Maria.

12:45.598 --> 12:48.517
I believe our utmost priority
should be clear.

12:49.226 --> 12:50.227
I see.

12:50.811 --> 12:55.232
Tell me, from where
would you launch this operation?

12:56.066 --> 12:56.901
Pyxis.

12:57.234 --> 13:00.821
The wall has been completely
sealed in Trost District, correct?

13:01.280 --> 13:02.114
Yes.

13:02.448 --> 13:04.742
I doubt its gate will ever open again.

13:05.784 --> 13:08.329
We hope to depart from Calaneth District
and head to the east.

13:08.996 --> 13:10.581
From there,
we would approach Shiganshina...

13:11.582 --> 13:14.043
by establishing a new route.

13:14.126 --> 13:15.461
Wait a damn minute!

13:15.669 --> 13:18.839
Shouldn't we be sealing all the gates now?

13:18.923 --> 13:22.593
The gates are the only part
the Colossal Titan can break!

13:22.676 --> 13:26.222
If we can just reinforce them,
we'll never get attacked again!

13:26.347 --> 13:28.307
Shut up, you merchant dog!

13:28.682 --> 13:32.394
With a Titan's help,
we can return to Wall Maria!

13:32.728 --> 13:36.565
We can't put up with any more of
your childish heroics!

13:36.857 --> 13:38.651
You have a big mouth on you, swine.

13:39.693 --> 13:41.320
How can you be sure

13:41.695 --> 13:44.281
that the Titans will wait
while we reinforce the gates?

13:45.115 --> 13:48.911
And when you say "we",
you mean the friends you're protecting

13:48.994 --> 13:50.246
so you can fatten yourselves up.

13:51.539 --> 13:54.625
Are you pigs blind to the people

13:54.708 --> 13:57.211
who struggle to survive off
what little land is left?

13:57.711 --> 14:02.091
I'm just saying that all we have to do
is to seal the gates if we want to live--

14:02.174 --> 14:04.760
Hold your tongue, you miscreant!

14:05.219 --> 14:07.012
You would suggest

14:07.096 --> 14:09.598
that humans meddle with Wall Rose,
a gift from God?

14:10.599 --> 14:14.520
That wall is a divine miracle
that transcends human understanding!

14:14.603 --> 14:17.022
- Do you still not realize
- It's their fault that it took so long

14:17.106 --> 14:19.775
- that humanity must not touch it?
- to arm the top of the walls.

14:19.942 --> 14:22.403
They have that much support and power now.

14:22.778 --> 14:23.779
They're a bad lot.

14:24.864 --> 14:25.823
That's disrespectful!

14:25.906 --> 14:28.200
Shut it, you lousy priest!

14:28.284 --> 14:29.118
What?

14:31.912 --> 14:32.913
Order!

14:33.289 --> 14:37.001
I ask that you save your personal
sentiments for another venue.

14:37.543 --> 14:39.962
I wish to make certain of something,
Mr. Jaeger.

14:40.754 --> 14:44.341
As a soldier,
can you continue to serve humanity

14:44.425 --> 14:47.052
by controlling your Titan ability?

14:47.303 --> 14:49.013
Yes, sir! I can!

14:49.513 --> 14:50.347
Really?

14:50.681 --> 14:54.977
But it says here in this report
on the Trost battle that,

14:55.895 --> 15:00.816
just after transforming,
you swung your fists at Mikasa Ackermann.

15:03.193 --> 15:06.864
He doesn't remember
that he wasn't in control.

15:07.948 --> 15:10.117
What, you expect me to lie in a report?

15:10.618 --> 15:14.246
Hiding this fact wouldn't do
humanity any good.

15:14.413 --> 15:16.081
And who is Mikasa Ackermann?

15:16.165 --> 15:17.750
I am, sir.

15:18.542 --> 15:19.376
You?

15:19.960 --> 15:23.505
Is it true that Jaeger,
in Titan form, attacked you?

15:25.591 --> 15:29.219
It's in Eren's best interest
that you answer honestly.

15:34.892 --> 15:36.685
Yes. It's true.

15:38.938 --> 15:41.649
I knew it! A Titan's a Titan!

15:41.899 --> 15:44.068
I tried to kill Mikasa?

15:45.027 --> 15:45.945
Me?

15:47.279 --> 15:48.280
However,

15:48.405 --> 15:50.115
he also saved my life

15:51.033 --> 15:53.702
on two prior occasions
while in Titan form.

15:54.411 --> 15:55.412
The first time,

15:55.913 --> 15:59.041
just as I was about to
fall into the hands of a Titan,

15:59.124 --> 16:02.419
he intervened and protected me.

16:04.380 --> 16:09.093
The second time, he protected
me and Armin from a bombardment.

16:10.427 --> 16:13.430
I ask that you take these facts
into consideration as well.

16:13.764 --> 16:14.848
Just a minute!

16:15.849 --> 16:17.226
I believe that her testimony

16:17.309 --> 16:20.312
is also very driven by personal feelings.

16:20.896 --> 16:24.108
It should be noted that Mikasa Ackermann
lost her parents at a young age

16:24.191 --> 16:27.444
and was taken in by the Jaeger family.

16:29.822 --> 16:33.242
What's more,
our own investigation into this matter

16:33.325 --> 16:35.619
led us to a most surprising discovery.

16:37.663 --> 16:41.542
Eren Jaeger and Mikasa Ackermann,
at the age of nine,

16:41.834 --> 16:45.421
stabbed and killed
three adult robber-kidnappers.

16:46.797 --> 16:48.841
Even if it was in self-defense,

16:49.091 --> 16:52.636
we cannot help but question
his basic humanity.

16:53.178 --> 16:55.681
Should we really place
lives and funds in his hands,

16:55.764 --> 16:59.309
not to mention the very fate of humanity?

16:59.935 --> 17:00.853
That's right!

17:00.978 --> 17:04.440
He's clearly a Titan that has snuck in
by taking the form of a child!

17:04.648 --> 17:05.816
Her too!

17:06.692 --> 17:08.777
I bet she's not human at all!

17:08.861 --> 17:11.405
Yes! We should dissect her
just to be safe!

17:11.613 --> 17:12.698
Hold on!

17:13.032 --> 17:16.410
I might be a monster,
but she has nothing to do with this!

17:16.702 --> 17:17.870
Nothing at all!

17:17.995 --> 17:19.955
- As if we can believe you!
- It's the truth!

17:20.039 --> 17:22.833
- She is one if you have to protect her!
- No!

17:26.587 --> 17:28.964
No... It's not like that.

17:30.132 --> 17:36.472
But you're all using speculation
to push your own selfish agendas!

17:37.097 --> 17:38.974
What?

17:39.558 --> 17:40.809
In fact...

17:41.101 --> 17:41.935
Is this bad?

17:42.019 --> 17:46.023
...none of you have even seen a Titan,
so why are you so afraid?

17:46.482 --> 17:48.233
Maybe I should stop talking...

17:49.318 --> 17:53.238
No, I'm going to tell them
everything that's on my mind!

17:54.406 --> 17:57.743
What's the use of having power
if you're not going to fight?

17:58.786 --> 18:03.499
If you're afraid of fighting
for your lives, then help me!

18:03.874 --> 18:06.168
You cowards!

18:06.376 --> 18:07.211
What?

18:07.336 --> 18:08.837
Just shut up,

18:09.046 --> 18:11.340
and place everything in me!

18:17.096 --> 18:18.013
Take aim!

18:18.097 --> 18:18.931
Yes, sir!

18:23.602 --> 18:24.436
What?

18:35.739 --> 18:37.074
Wait, Mikasa!

18:43.539 --> 18:44.998
My personal belief...

18:46.083 --> 18:48.710
is that pain is the best tool
for teaching discipline.

18:49.378 --> 18:51.255
What you need now

18:51.839 --> 18:54.591
is to be taught a lesson,
not be given a talking-to.

18:55.134 --> 18:57.845
And you happen to be
in perfect kicking position.

19:08.188 --> 19:09.940
Wait, Levi!

19:10.858 --> 19:11.692
What?

19:13.652 --> 19:14.653
That's dangerous.

19:15.320 --> 19:17.990
What if he gets mad
and turns into a Titan?

19:21.034 --> 19:22.202
Don't be silly.

19:23.287 --> 19:26.415
You guys are going to
dissect him, aren't you?

19:28.792 --> 19:30.752
When he was transformed,

19:31.003 --> 19:34.298
he apparently managed to kill 20 Titans
before running out of strength.

19:35.424 --> 19:38.677
As an enemy, his intelligence
makes him all the more dangerous.

19:39.636 --> 19:41.805
Even so, I could handle him just fine.

19:42.890 --> 19:44.433
But could you?

19:45.517 --> 19:48.020
Whoever dares to torment him
better think long and hard.

19:48.729 --> 19:51.106
Can you actually kill him?

19:52.441 --> 19:54.484
Sir. I have a proposition.

19:54.943 --> 19:55.944
What is it?

19:57.321 --> 20:01.408
Eren's Titan ability includes
too many uncertainties

20:01.867 --> 20:03.493
which pose an ever-present danger.

20:04.745 --> 20:08.165
As such, we will place Eren
under Captain Levi's supervision

20:08.415 --> 20:10.250
and conduct a recon mission
outside the wall.

20:10.334 --> 20:12.252
With Eren accompanying you?

20:12.628 --> 20:13.462
Yes, sir.

20:13.754 --> 20:16.089
Based on the results of said mission,

20:17.341 --> 20:19.927
you can decide if Eren
has control over his Titan ability

20:21.011 --> 20:23.555
and if his existence
is beneficial to humankind.

20:23.805 --> 20:26.308
Supervising Eren Jaeger, is it?

20:27.184 --> 20:29.144
Can you do this, Levi?

20:30.062 --> 20:32.606
Oh, I can most definitely kill him.

20:33.023 --> 20:36.568
The real problem is that
there's no middle ground.

20:42.532 --> 20:44.117
I've made my decision.

20:49.039 --> 20:51.458
Man, talk about harsh.

20:52.292 --> 20:54.294
- I bet it hurts.
- A little.

20:54.795 --> 20:56.713
So, how exactly does it hurt?

20:58.048 --> 20:59.091
I'm sorry about that.

21:00.050 --> 21:03.553
But it did get you placed in our custody.

21:03.637 --> 21:04.471
Yes.

21:05.013 --> 21:06.556
The pain was worth it.

21:06.640 --> 21:10.727
It let us play our trump card
when it would be most effective.

21:12.437 --> 21:13.605
You have my admiration.

21:15.732 --> 21:17.943
Eren, I look forward to working with you.

21:18.610 --> 21:20.612
Right! Thank you, sir!

21:23.657 --> 21:24.658
Tell me, Eren.

21:24.741 --> 21:25.826
Yes?

21:26.618 --> 21:28.036
Do you resent me?

21:28.120 --> 21:29.371
No.

21:29.871 --> 21:32.582
I understand it was
a necessary performance.

21:32.666 --> 21:33.750
Good, then.

21:33.834 --> 21:36.003
Still, you didn't have to go so far.

21:36.545 --> 21:38.130
You knocked his tooth out!

21:39.006 --> 21:41.425
- See?
- Don't pick that up. It's disgusting.

21:41.717 --> 21:43.927
This is a precious sample of its own.

21:44.011 --> 21:47.723
Be thankful you aren't getting dissected
by people like her, Eren.

21:48.015 --> 21:50.100
Don't compare me to them.

21:50.517 --> 21:53.228
I would never kill Eren.

21:53.687 --> 21:56.732
Hey, Eren. Let me see inside your mouth.

22:05.198 --> 22:06.116
The tooth...

22:07.117 --> 22:08.577
has already grown back.

23:43.004 --> 23:47.092
After achieving his dream
of joining the Scout Regiment,

23:47.717 --> 23:52.639
Eren discovers that the Scouts
are a band of people who seek change,

23:53.223 --> 23:55.934
as well as a haven
of eccentrics and oddballs.
